derived order beats typing and row-major: B1 A1
a range names the cells between its corners: A2 D1
a cycle is named, not spun: REFUSED: a cycle through A1 B1
the full order of the chain plus an independent cell: B1 E1 C1 D1
editing the DATA cell A1 recomputes: B1 C1 D1
editing the FORMULA cell C1 recomputes: C1 D1
editing the independent cell E1 recomputes: E1
editing a cell nothing names recomputes: (none)
a formula that does not parse is reported before the sort: REFUSED: A1 does not parse: the formula ends where a value was wanted
a second formula for one cell replaces the first: entries 1
